meta {
  name: 08 raw the data on its own
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/_nl
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "prompt": "how many products are out of stock",
    "response": "raw"
  }
}

docs {
  What you get back - raw, the data on its own

  "response": "raw" gives you "result" and nothing else: exactly what Elasticsearch answered, and no second call to the model, so it is the fastest of the three.
}
